<title>NETHERLANDS: MOTORCYCLING-WORLD SUPERBIKE CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-WORLD SUPERBIKE CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ASSEN, Netherlands 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
